{:id "0040-lab-card-clarity"
 :title "Lab card clarity: the rest of the line steps back while a card holds the stage"
 :lupa/deps #{"0041-lab-stage-flash-test"}
 :lupa/area :lab
 :lupa/risk :low
 :goal "A card (the director's trailer shot) sets its phrase large on the
        current line's height, 0.3 em in front, while the other letters dim
        to 0.25 (the foreman's spec in 0035). In the screenshots the dimmed
        letters show through between the card's strokes ('hello there'
        under 'WHAT A DAY!'), because glyph quads are transparent, so the
        card reads as a muddle rather than a title. A trailer card owns the
        frame. Make the rest of the line step back: much fainter and
        further away, then return exactly as before."
 :scope ["src/halfahead/lab/pose.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/pose_test.cljc"
         "e2e/lab.mjs" "docs/LAB.md"]
 :design "In halfahead.lab.pose's card performance only: every live glyph
          that is not in the card blends, by the same envelope that dims it
          today, towards opacity at most 0.08 and z at its unperformed z
          minus 2.0 em (behind the line, so perspective also shrinks it
          towards the vanishing point). Card letters are unchanged. Fix the
          card-z docstring, which claims the dimmed line never shows
          through; say what is true instead. Ghosts are untouched.
          Tests (pose_test.cljc): at the middle of a card's hold every
          non-card live pose has opacity <= 0.08 and z <= its pose without
          the shot minus 1.9; 5 s after the card began every pose equals
          the frame without the direction (the existing settle check);
          reduced motion still performs no card. Update 'the rest dims to
          0.25' accordingly.
          e2e/lab.mjs: the director's card step asserts opacity <= 0.08 and
          z recession for the others instead of 0.25, and saves card.png as
          before. docs/LAB.md: the two lines that say 0.25."
 :acceptance
 ["pose tests: the hold-time fade and recession, and the full return after
   the card, as above; every existing pose property still passes"
  "`bb lab:e2e` passes with the updated card step and all other steps;
   `bb test` stays green; out/lab/card.png for the foreman"]
 :non-goals
 ["No change to the card's timing, size or position, to push or pull, to
   the director's rules, cues, styles, sound, reveal or stage"
  "Do not edit the schema; do not run `bb e2e` or `bb play`"]
 :context ["src/halfahead/lab/pose.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/pose_test.cljc"
           "e2e/lab.mjs" "docs/LAB.md"]
 :budget-usd 8.0}
